      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. NUMBER SYSTEM – BASIC CONCEPT"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Covers fundamental concepts of the Number System and classification of numbers.",
        "Emphasizes core mathematical properties critical for SSC competitive exams.",
        "Focuses on divisibility rules, factors, and multiples as high-yield problem-solving tools.",
        "Provides structured practice with solved examples, test questions, and an answer key."
      ],
      "id": "yvd0iow"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kn3xdks",
      "content": "Number System deals with classification and properties of numbers used in calculations.<br></br><br></br>In SBIexamination, questions from Number System are:<br></br>• Basic<br></br>• Concept-based<br></br>• Usually one or two steps only"
    },
    {
