      "content": "Q1. Which of the following is not a composite number?<br></br>A. 1   B. 4   C. 6   D. 9<br></br><br></br>Q2. Find the number of factors of 16.<br></br>A. 4   B. 5   C. 6   D. 7<br></br><br></br>Q3. Which number is divisible by 11?<br></br>A. 121   B. 132   C. 143   D. 154"
